HED version="8.5.0"

'''Prologue'''
Test fixture for the value-text character set: an 8.5.0 schema whose textClass row names value-text as the HED 8.5.0 prerelease will. A textClass value may not contain parentheses or the number sign or the tilde. The unit classes and unit modifiers and schema attributes and properties are copied from the redundant_unit_8.5.0 fixture without its redundant uV unit.

!# start schema

'''Note''' <nowiki>[Test tag whose value is free text.]</nowiki>
* # <nowiki>{takesValue, valueClass=textClass}</nowiki>

'''Tag-name''' <nowiki>[Test tag whose value is a name.]</nowiki>
* # <nowiki>{takesValue, valueClass=nameClass}</nowiki>

!# end schema

'''Unit classes'''
