** V <nowiki>{SIUnit, unitSymbol, conversionFactor=1000000, hedId=HED_0011609}</nowiki>
** volt <nowiki>{SIUnit, conversionFactor=1000000, hedId=HED_0011610}</nowiki>
* timeUnits <nowiki>{defaultUnits=s, hedId=HED_0011513} [Units of time, for example durations, delays, and intervals between events.]</nowiki>
** second <nowiki>{SIUnit, conversionFactor=1.0, hedId=HED_0011633}</nowiki>
** s <nowiki>{SIUnit, unitSymbol, conversionFactor=1.0, hedId=HED_0011634}</nowiki>
** day <nowiki>{conversionFactor=86400, hedId=HED_0011635}</nowiki>
** week <nowiki>{conversionFactor=604800}</nowiki>
** month <nowiki>{hedId=HED_0011645}</nowiki>
** minute <nowiki>{conversionFactor=60, hedId=HED_0011636}</nowiki>
** hour <nowiki>{conversionFactor=3600, hedId=HED_0011637} [Should be in 24-hour format.]</nowiki>

